WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.880
Another thing Dr. Bright is not&nbsp;
allowed to do at the Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:06.320
Dr. Bright! Stop sending Able after Forum Trolls!

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:11.120
Able is a humanoid SCP with super strength&nbsp;
and an insatiable need to destroy any human&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:15.040
life he encounters. Forum trolls are really&nbsp;
annoying, and it stinks when they call you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:18.960
rude names or imply that you'll be "forever&nbsp;
alone," but Dr. Bright...you can't harness&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:23.120
Able's bloodlust in order to punish them!
You're not supposed to ever feed the trolls,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:26.720
but you shouldn't send immortal humanoid&nbsp;
anomalies to destroy them either.

